ying data corruption.</li><li><strong>Government Compliance:</strong> Meets rigid standards for FIPS 180-4 and Suite B.</li><li><strong>Signature Strength:</strong> Used in certificates requiring high-order digital signatures.</li><li><strong>Collision Avoidance:</strong> Practically zero probability of two different inputs sharing a hash.</li></ul>'
