assword Salting:</strong> Providing a massive entropy pool for secondary password hashing layers.</li><li><strong>Integrity Proofs:</strong> Building time-stamped proof-of-existence ledgers.</li><li><strong>Data Forensics:</strong> Comparing large datasets during security audits to detect unauthorized changes.</li></ul>'
